%%{init: {"theme": "neutral", "fontFamily": "Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif", "flowchart": {"htmlLabels": false, "curve": "basis"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as You
  participant A as Agent (apply-by-email)
  participant C as scoutjobs CLI
  participant S as Your SMTP server
  U->>A: "send the Stripe application"
  A->>C: scoutjobs job show 3 --json
  C-->>A: dir, contact, kit files
  alt cover-letter.md or resume missing
    A-->>U: run /scoutjobs:cover or /scoutjobs:tailor first
  end
  A->>C: scoutjobs email draft 3 --to hr@stripe.com
  C-->>A: email.json + email.eml written, message printed
  A-->>U: From, To, Subject, attachments, full body
  A->>U: Send it? (full sentence, waits)
  U-->>A: yes
  A->>C: scoutjobs email send 3 --yes
  C->>S: STARTTLS / TLS, password from $SCOUTJOBS_SMTP_PASSWORD
  S-->>C: 250 accepted
  C-->>A: email-sent.eml saved, event email:sent, status applied
  A-->>U: sent, follow-up timer started
